y_management_view","zh":"$TRADITION_VIEW_TITLE$界面","en":"$TRADITION_VIEW_TITLE$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":43,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":36,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147413"},{"key":"concept_society_management","zh":"$TRADITION_VIEW_TITLE$","en":"$TRADITION_VIEW_TITLE$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":44,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":37,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147414"},{"key":"concept_society_management_desc","zh":"§H$concept_society_management_view$§!可以对传统进行管理。$ui_available_tabs$[GetConceptSocietyManagement]","en":"The §H$concept_society_management_view$§! allows management of traditions.$ui_available_tabs$[GetConceptSocietyManagement]","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":45,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":38,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147415"},{"key":"society_management_view_tab_traditions","zh":"§H$TRADITIONS$§!","en":"§H$TRADITIONS$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":46,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":39,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147416"},{"key":"society_management_view_tab_crisis","zh":"§H$CRISIS_TAB$§!","en":"§H$CRISIS_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":47,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":40,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147417"},{"key":"concept_society_management_view_crisis","zh":"$concept_society_management_view_no_crisis$\\n—$society_management_view_tab_crisis$：追踪作为['concept_crisis']的进展","en":"$concept_society_management_view_no_crisis$\\n- $society_management_view_tab_crisis$: track progress as the ['concept_crisis']","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":48,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":41,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147418"},{"key":"concept_society_management_view_no_crisis","zh":"—$society_management_view_tab_traditions$：选择['concept_traditions']和['concept_ascension_perks']","en":"- $society_management_view_tab_traditions$: select ['concept_traditions'] and ['concept_ascension_perks']","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":49,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":42,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147419"},{"key":"concept_technology_view","zh":"$TECHNOLOGY$界面","en":"$TECHNOLOGY$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":52,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":44,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147420"},{"key":"concept_technology_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_technology_view$§!展示了帝国在£physics£ ['concept_physics_research']，£society£ ['concept_society_research']，以及£engineering£ ['concept_engineering_research']领域的研究进展。通过该界面可选择研究项目并管理科技优先级。\\n\\n新的['concept_technologies']会从可用选项中半随机呈现，以体现科学探索的不可预测性。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_technology_view$§! displays an empire's scientific progress across the fields of £physics£ ['concept_physics_research'], £society£ ['concept_society_research'], and £engineering£ ['concept_engineering_research']. From this interface, research options are selected and technological priorities are managed.\\n\\nNew ['concept_technologies'] are presented semi-randomly from available options, reflecting the unpredictability of scientific inquiry.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":53,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":45,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147421"},{"key":"concept_leaders_view","zh":"$topbar_button_leaders_name$界面","en":"$topbar_button_leaders_name$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":56,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":47,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147422"},{"key":"concept_leaders_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_leaders_view$§!提供帝国境内所有活跃的['concept_leaders']的概览，包括他们的职责、['concept_leader_traits']、经验等级和当前的任务。通过此界面，可以招募新的领袖，重新分配现有领袖，或使其退役。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_leaders_view$§! provides an overview of all active ['concept_leaders'] within the empire, including their roles, ['concept_leader_traits'], experience levels, and current assignments. From this interface, new leaders may be recruited, existing ones reassigned, or retired from service.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":57,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":48,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147423"},{"key":"concept_species_view","zh":"$topbar_button_species_name$界面","en":"$topbar_button_species_name$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":60,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":50,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147424"},{"key":"concept_species_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_species_view$§!提供帝国境内所有已知['concept_species']的全面列表。通过此界面，可以检查和修饰['concept_species_traits']，并管理人口权利，例如公民身份、兵役和['concept_living_standards']。\\n\\n此视图对于驾驭多种族帝国的复杂性至关重要，在这样的帝国中，政策、生物学和意识形态交织在一起，塑造着星海社会。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_species_view$§! offers a comprehensive listing of all known ['concept_species'] within the empire. From this interface, it is possible to examine and modify ['concept_species_traits'], and manage population rights such as citizenship, military service, and ['concept_living_standards'].\\n\\nThis view is essential for navigating the complexities of a multi-species empire, where policy, biology, and ideology intertwine in the shaping of galactic society.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":61,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":51,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147425"},{"key":"concept_planets_and_sector_view","zh":"$PLANET_LIST$界面","en":"$PLANET_LIST$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":64,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":53,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147426"},{"key":"concept_planets_and_sector","zh":"$PLANET_LIST$","en":"$PLANET_LIST$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":65,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":54,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147427"},{"key":"concept_planets_and_sector_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_planets_and_sector$§!界面提供帝国境内所有£colony£ ['concept_colonies']和£sector£ ['concept_sector']的集中概览。\\n\\n在该视图中，也可以分配['concept_governors']。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_planets_and_sector$§! interface provides a centralized overview of all £colony£ ['concept_colonies'] and £sector£ ['concept_sector'] within the empire.\\n\\nIn this view, ['concept_governors'] can also be assigned.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":66,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":55,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147428"},{"key":"concept_expansion_planner","zh":"$MENU_PANEL__EXPANSION_PLANNER_TITLE$","en":"$MENU_PANEL__EXPANSION_PLANNER_TITLE$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":69,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":57,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147429"},{"key":"concept_expansion_planner_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_expansion_planner$§!列出了可能殖民的£planet£['concept_planets']。从该窗口中可以直接进行殖民，并将会自动建造£colony_ship£['concept_colony_ship']。\\n\\n£planet£§H$concept_planets$§!必须先通过£science_ship£['concept_science_ship']的调查，并且所有在其上发现的£anomaly£['concept_anomalies']必须先完成研究后才能进行殖民。\\n\\n此外，在该行星所在的恒星系还需要建立['concept_starbase']，这样才能将该行星划入帝国的疆域内。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_expansion_planner$§! lists £planet£ ['concept_planets'] that present opportunities for colonization. Colonization can be started directly from this screen, which automatically builds a £colony_ship£ ['concept_colony_ship'].\\n\\n£planet£ §H$concept_planets$§! must be surveyed by a £science_ship£ ['concept_science_ship'] and any £anomaly£ ['concept_anomalies'] found on the planet must be investigated before the planet can be colonized.\\n\\nA ['concept_starbase'] must also have been constructed in the planet's system, so that it lies within the empire's borders.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":70,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":58,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147430"},{"key":"concept_fleet_management_view","zh":"$topbar_button_fleet_manager_name$界面","en":"$topbar_button_fleet_manager_name$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":73,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":60,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147431"},{"key":"concept_fleet_management","zh":"$topbar_button_fleet_