ocalisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":89,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147458"},{"key":"concept_claims_view","zh":"$CLAIMS_VIEW$界面","en":"$CLAIMS_VIEW$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":107,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":91,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147459"},{"key":"concept_claims_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_claims_view$§!显示帝国拥有的所有领土['concept_claims']。['concept_galaxy_map']的外交模式清晰地展示了有争议的星系以及未来潜在冲突的爆发点。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_claims_view$§! displays all territorial ['concept_claims'] held by the empire.The Diplomatic mode of the ['concept_galaxy_map'] provides a clear overview of contested systems and potential flashpoints for future conflict.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":108,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":92,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147460"},{"key":"concept_market_view","zh":"$MARKET_VIEW$界面","en":"$MARKET_VIEW$ View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":111,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":94,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147461"},{"key":"concept_market_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_market_view$§!提供了一个星际贸易的总览，包括用于买卖资源或建立周期性的月度交易之类的信息。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_market_view$§! provides a framework for interstellar trade, the buying and selling of resources, or establishing recurring monthly transactions.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":112,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":95,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147462"},{"key":"concept_colony_view","zh":"殖民地界面","en":"Colony View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":115,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":97,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147463"},{"key":"concept_colony_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_colony_view$§!可以对£colony£['concept_colony']进行管理。在合适的未殖民£planet£['concept_planets']或['concept_habitats']上，该界面可以用于开始§H殖民§!流程。$ui_available_tabs$$concept_colony_view_tabs$","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_colony_view$§! allows administration of a £colony£ ['concept_colony']. On suitable uninhabited £planet£ ['concept_planets'] or ['concept_habitats'], this view can be used to start the §HColonization§! process.$ui_available_tabs$$concept_colony_view_tabs$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":116,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":98,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147464"},{"key":"colony_view_tab_planet_summary","zh":"§H$PLANET_TAB$§!","en":"§H$PLANET_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":117,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":99,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147465"},{"key":"colony_view_tab_management","zh":"§H$MANAGEMENT_TAB$§!","en":"§H$MANAGEMENT_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":118,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":100,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147466"},{"key":"colony_view_tab_population","zh":"§H$POPULATION_TAB$§!","en":"§H$POPULATION_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":119,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":101,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147467"},{"key":"colony_view_tab_armies","zh":"§H$GROUND_COMBAT_TAB$§!","en":"§H$GROUND_COMBAT_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":120,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":102,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147468"},{"key":"colony_view_tab_holdings","zh":"§H$CORPORATE_TAB$§!","en":"§H$CORPORATE_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":121,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":103,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147469"},{"key":"concept_colony_view_tabs","zh":"—$colony_view_tab_planet_summary$：展示殖民地£district£['concept_districts']、£building£['concept_buildings']及所指派的['concept_governor']的总览。可以在此设置['concept_designation']或启用['concept_planet_automation']。\\n—$colony_view_tab_management$：展示所有行星特征及人口增减情况。在此可以颁布['concept_decisions']、['concept_planetary_ascension']或发起['concept_terraforming']。\\n—$colony_view_tab_population$：按不同£job£['concept_job']阶层展示殖民地人口。\\n—$colony_view_tab_armies$：展示殖民地所存在的陆军，以及该殖民地所遭受到的['concept_devastation']。\\n—$colony_view_tab_holdings$：总览殖民地的所有['concept_overlord_holdings']。","en":"- $colony_view_tab_planet_summary$: shows an overview of the colony's £district£ ['concept_districts'], £building£ ['concept_buildings'], and any assigned ['concept_governor']. Here it is possible to set a ['concept_designation'], or enable ['concept_planet_automation'].\\n- $colony_view_tab_management$: shows any planetary features and population changes. Here it is possible to enact ['concept_decisions'], ['concept_planetary_ascension'], or start ['concept_terraforming'].\\n- $colony_view_tab_population$: shows the colony's population divided into £job£ ['concept_job'] stratas.\\n- $colony_view_tab_armies$: shows any ground forces in the colony, and how much ['concept_devastation'] the colony has suffered.\\n- $colony_view_tab_holdings$: provides an overview of all the ['concept_overlord_holdings'] in the colony.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":122,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":104,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147470"},{"key":"concept_starbase_view","zh":"恒星基地界面","en":"Starbase View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":125,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":106,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147471"},{"key":"concept_starbase_view_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_starbase_view$§!可以对一座['concept_starbase']进行管理。$ui_available_tabs$$concept_starbase_view_tabs$","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_starbase_view$§! allows administration of a ['concept_starbase'].$ui_available_tabs$$concept_starbase_view_tabs$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":126,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":107,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147472"},{"key":"starbase_view_tab_command","zh":"§H$STARBASE_STARBASE_TAB$§!","en":"§H$STARBASE_STARBASE_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":127,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":108,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147473"},{"key":"starbase_view_tab_defenses","zh":"§H$STARBASE_DEFENSES_TAB$§!","en":"§H$STARBASE_DEFENSES_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":128,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":109,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147474"},{"key":"starbase_view_tab_armies","zh":"§H$MACRO_BUILDER_TAB$§!","en":"§H$MACRO_BUILDER_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":129,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":110,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147475"},{"key":"starbase_view_tab_shipyard","zh":"§H$STARBASE_SHIPYARD_TAB$§!","en":"§H$STARBASE_SHIPYARD_TAB$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":130,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":111,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147476"},{"key":"concept_starbase_view_tabs","zh":"—$starbase_view_tab_command$：总览恒星基地的§H模块§!和§H建筑§!。当研究所需['concept_technology']后还可以将恒星基地升级至下一等级\\n—$starbase_view_tab_defenses$：展示所存在的['concept_defense_platforms']，并可以通过点击型号进一步建造\\n—$starbase_view_tab_armies$：提供一种大批量组建§H$assault_army_plural$§!的方式。军队会在£sector£['concept_sector']内可用的£colony£['concept_colonies']上组建，并会在该恒星基地或是开启了§H集合陆军部队§!的§H陆军§!处集合\\n—$starbase_view_tab_shipyard$：用于建造['concept_civilian_ships']和['concept_military_ships']","en":"- $starbase_view_tab_command$: shows an overview of the starbase's §HModules§! and §HBuildings§!. It also enables upgrading the starbase to the next tier when the required ['concept_technology'] has been researched\\n- $starbase_view_tab_defenses$: shows any ['concept_defense_platforms'] and clicking a design builds more of them\\n- $starbase_view_tab_armies$: provides a way to assemble a large number of §H$assault_army_plural$§!. Armies are assembled on available £colony£ ['concept_colonies'] in the £sector£ ['concept_sector'], and are either gathered at the starbase or with an §HArmy§! with §HRally Troops§! enabled\\n- $starbase_view_tab_shipyard$: allows the building of both ['concept_civilian_ships'] and ['concept_military_ships']","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":131,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":112,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147477"},{"key":"concept_waystation_view","zh":"驿站界面","en":"Waystation View","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":134,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":114,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147478"},{"key":"concept_waystation_view_desc","zh":"£interface£ §H$concept_waystation_view$§!可以对£waystation£ ['concept_waystation']进行管理。$ui_available_tabs$$concept_waystation_view_tabs$","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_waystation_view$§! allows administration of a £waystation£ ['concept_waystation'].$ui_available_tabs$$concept_waystation_view_tabs$","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":135,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":115,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147479"},{"key":"waystation_view_tab_waystation","zh":"§H$waystation_starbase_tab$§!","en":"§H$waystation_starbase_tab$§!","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":136,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":116,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147480"},{"key":"concept_waystation_view_tabs","zh":"—$waystation_view_tab_waystation$：提供驿站§H模块§!与§H库存§!的总览界面。研发相关['concept_technology']后，可以在这里将驿站升级。","en":"- $waystation_view_tab_waystation$: shows an overview of the waystation's §HModules§! and §HStockpile§!. It also enables upgrading the waystation to the next tier when the required ['concept_technology'] has been researched.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":137,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":117,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147481"},{"key":"concept_system_map","zh":"恒星系地图","en":"System Map","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":140,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":119,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147482"},{"key":"concept_system_map_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_system_map$§!提供了一个恒星系的详细视图，包括['concept_celestial_objects']，['concept_civilian_space_stations']，['concept_fleets']以及轨道基础设施。它允许在星系内精确管理建造、殖民、作战行动和科学活动。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_system_map$§! presents a detailed view of an individual star system, including ['concept_celestial_objects'], ['concept_civilian_space_stations'], ['concept_fleets'], and orbital infrastructure. It allows for precise management of construction, colonization, combat operations, and scientific activity within the system.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":141,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":120,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147483"},{"key":"concept_galaxy_map","zh":"星系地图","en":"Galaxy Map","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":144,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":122,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147484"},{"key":"concept_galaxy_map_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_galaxy_map$§!提供已知星系的战略概览，显示£system£ ['concept_systems']、['concept_empire']边界以及['concept_hyperlanes']。它是探索、扩张和星际协调的主要界面。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_galaxy_map$§! offers a strategic overview of the known galaxy, displaying £system£ ['concept_systems'], ['concept_empire'] borders, and ['concept_hyperlanes']. It serves as the primary interface for exploration, expansion, and interstellar coordination.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":145,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":123,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147485"},{"key":"concept_navigation_bar","zh":"导航栏","en":"Navigation Bar","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":148,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":125,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147486"},{"key":"concept_navigation_bar_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_navigation_bar$§!在屏幕的左侧。\\n\\n它可以在交互时展开或锁定为最小化。\\n\\n展开状态下可以访问设置，对菜单项目重新排序。这也会改变用于快速打开各个菜单项的快捷键。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_navigation_bar$§! is on the left side of the screen.\\n\\nIt can either expand when interacted with or be locked in a minimal state.\\n\\nThe expanded mode allows access to settings where the menu items can be reordered. This also changes which keyboard shortcut that quickly opens each menu.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":149,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":126,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147487"},{"key":"concept_resource_bar","zh":"资源栏","en":"Resource Bar","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":152,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":128,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147488"},{"key":"concept_resource_bar_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_resource_bar$§!在屏幕的顶端。\\n\\n其中显示如£energy£['concept_energy']等各种§H资源§!以及如£trade_value£['concept_trade']、['concept_research']、['concept_starbase_capacity']还有['concept_naval_capacity']等各种指标。\\n\\n在其最右端是用于调整游戏速度快慢、暂停和解除暂停的§H时间控制§!。\\n\\n在§H时间控制§!下方是§H音乐播放器§!。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_resource_bar$§! is on the top of the screen.\\n\\nIt houses various §HResources§! such as £energy£ ['concept_energy'], and metrics such as £trade_value£ ['concept_trade'], ['concept_research'], ['concept_starbase_capacity'], and ['concept_naval_capacity'].\\n\\nTo the right are the §HTime Controls§! used to speed up or slow down the game, as well as pause and unpause.\\n\\nBelow the §HTime Controls§! is the §HMusic Player§!.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":153,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":129,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147489"},{"key":"concept_outliner","zh":"总览","en":"Outliner","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":156,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":131,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147490"},{"key":"concept_outliner_desc","zh":"£interface£§H$concept_outliner$§!提供了对帝国关键信息和要素的快速访问，包括£colony£ ['concept_colonies']、['concept_fleets']和['concept_civilian_space_stations']。作为一个可定制的界面，它允许快速导航和追踪信息，提供实时状态更新，并能直接控制重要行动。","en":"The £interface£ §H$concept_outliner$§! provides quick access to key assets across the empire, including £colony£ ['concept_colonies'], ['concept_fleets'], and ['concept_civilian_space_stations']. A customizable interface, it allows for rapid navigation and oversight, offering real-time status updates and direct control over vital operations.","source":"ui_concepts","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/ui_concepts_l_english.yml","el":157,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/ui_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":132,"status":"paired","id":"texts:147491"}]}